  "body_html": "<h1>wsum_wsum_comm</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem wsum_wsum_comm {J : Type*} [Fintype J] (x : stdSimplex 𝕜 I) (y : stdSimplex 𝕜 J) (A : I → J → 𝕜) : wsum x (fun i =&gt; wsum y (A i)) = wsum y (fun j =&gt; wsum x (fun i =&gt; A i j))</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Profile.ext</li>\n</ul>",
